Third-party material
--------------------
The visual-field curves in the introduction follow Figure 1a of Johannes
Zauner, Kai Broszio and Karin Bieske (2023), based on Guth's representation.
assets/figures/schema.png and assets/figures/aufsatz.png are excerpts from
Figures 1b and 6d of the same paper. Credit all three authors for these
materials. The paper is licensed under CC BY 4.0.
https://doi.org/10.3390/clockssleep5030032

DM Sans and Instrument Serif use the SIL Open Font License 1.1. Their
copyright notices and licence texts are in assets/fonts/DM-Sans-LICENSE.txt
and assets/fonts/Instrument-Serif-LICENSE.txt.

The pako inflate library carries the MIT licence and copyright notice of
Vitaly Puzrin and Andrei Tuputcyn in assets/pako-inflate.min.js.

